## 七、`while let` — 遍历嵌套 Option

```rust
let maybe_nums = vec![Some(1), None, Some(3)];

let mut iter = maybe_nums.into_iter();
while let Some(x) = iter.next() {
    println!("{:?}", x);  // Some(1), None, Some(3) 逐个打印
